  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Is Key: send 500 Ugandan kids to school!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us to empower families in Uganda in 2023! Our mission is to empower families in Uganda to rise above poverty. We use an integrated approach and focus on the development of economic, social, natural, human, and cultural capital. 22STARS collaborates with communities in Acholi Quarter in the capital Kampala and Danida in Jinja, who live in extreme poverty after having fled conflict zones in Northern Uganda and neighbouring countries.  With your donation we pay for meals and school fees.</narrative>
  </description>
